This project is a TypeScript monorepo with a NestJS API and a Nuxt PWA frontend.

## Structure

- `apps/api`: NestJS backend
  - `src/modules`: feature modules with controllers, services, and DTOs
  - `src/entities`: TypeORM entities
  - `src/common`: shared utilities, guards, interceptors
- `apps/pwa`: Nuxt 4 frontend
  - `pages`: route-level views
  - `components`: reusable UI components
  - `composables`: shared logic via Composition API
  - `stores`: Pinia state (if present)
  - `assets/css/tailwind.css`: Tailwind entrypoint

## Source of Truth

- Product scope and domain definitions live in the PRD:
